2030 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Development Division exists to solve one core problem\072 founders and businesses with a great idea rarely have a single partner who can take that idea all the way to a live\054 functioning\054 growing digital product\056 They\047re forced to stitch together freelance designers\054 developers\054 QA testers\054 and marketers \055 each with no visibility into what the others are doing\054 and no one owning the outcome\056\n\nFlo Studios replaces that fragmentation with a single\054 integrated build lifecycle\056 We manage the entire journey of turning an idea into a live product \055 from the first planning conversation to post\055launch growth \055 as one continuous\054 connected process\056 Every stage is handled by specialists who are already aligned with what came before and what comes next\054 so nothing gets lost in translation between design\054 development\054 and launch\056\nWe don\047t sell deliverables\056 We sell a product that works\054 and the outcome of it going live successfully\056)
     /K [ 28 ]
     /P 2031 0 R
     /Pg 1974 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

